{
  "Enemies.OmnibusOverseer.Desc": "The 'woman' before you is clothed only in a single strip of fabric that wraps around her bountiful chest. She has striking red eyes that contrast visibly with her blue skin and dark make-up. Shiny black gloss encapsulates her kissable bubbly black lips. Her most striking feature is her crotch, which appears neither male nor female. She has a puffy wet vulva, but a cock-shaped protrusion sprouts from where a clit should be."
